Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Putting that aside, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:05.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's go eat somewhere once Senjougahara comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have anything you like to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like any kind of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your hands were also rather tasty. {rinTLC: orig: "Your hands are also delicious." TASTY is a win word, though.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My hands are not food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:28.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just being humble. They really were tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:33.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Speaking of which, you probably really did swallow some of my flesh and blood,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I can't exactly take your words lightly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji, I don't quite understand why, but you want to see your mother, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was under the belief that it's rather normal for children to want to see their mother. Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, of course not, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You live with your parents, right? That's why you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you lived by yourself, I think you would want to see them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.46,0:02:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that how it is? {rinTLC: or "I wonder..." or "Is that how it is?" or "You could be right...", uncertainly and questioning. :x}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:54.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the way you've been speaking, I get the feeling that you don't really like your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like that. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Up until middle school, I was a really good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't disobey my parents for any reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.35,0:03:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was really grateful to them for raising me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:10.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when I got to high school, I fell behind in my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then the good-kid image that I had maintained took a complete turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had this unspeakable, unpleasant kind of feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.04,0:03:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you're always like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:32.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of that, they said that's why no matter how much time passes, I'll never grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never growing up. Always just a child. Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A child? Then you're just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:44.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it's a bit different than you, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.60,0:03:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They probably mean something along the line of,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:48.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"He's grown up on the outside, but inside he hasn't changed at all." {rinTLC: literally, "gotten big on the outside, but the inside isn't keeping up"}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:53.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, Araragi-san, I'm considered quite mature amongst my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true. Your chest {\i1}is{\i0} pretty developed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.99,0:03:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You touched it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.91,0:04:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you touch it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we were fighting. {rinTLC: or "grappling" or just "fighting" or whatever the hell you think best describes what they were doing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:06.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My first touch has been taken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.87,0:04:07.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First touch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:12.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To actually have a first touch before a first kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji Mayoi has turned into a pervert! {rinTLC: or "dirty" or "lewd" or "indecent" ... you get the point.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's right, Hachikuji-chan. I completely forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:22.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promised you that I'd give you some allowance, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that with such horrible timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:31.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, there, there. {rinTLC: like a "calm down" sort of expression}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:33.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, you don't look even the least bit apologetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:37.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should at least say something after touching a girl's delicate chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:40.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.74,0:04:44.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm asking you to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, it doesn't really matter, does it? It's not that big a deal. {rinTLC: Second part is literally "it's not something that decreases"... you know, you don't have a limited number of chest touches before they're all gone, basically. If you want to put something like that, and can make it sound good, feel free I guess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that they'll get bigger if you rub them. {rinTLC: HE'S TALKING ABOUT HER BOOBIES.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:52.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! You've been using that superstition as a shield
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.63,0:04:55.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to constantly touch girls' breasts, haven't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the worst. {rinTLC: this is a common (literal) translation. I personally like "You're horrible" or something along those lines better, but I will defer judgement. :p}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:59.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I've never had such an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see you're just a stupid virgin, aren't you?{?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.51,0:05:07.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously, it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been touched by a virgin! I've been contaminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same no matter who touches you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to lose my slight feeling of guilt! {rinTLC: I feel like the ! makes it almost sound like he's regretting it; he is not. fix this, unless i'm crazy.}{changed from "gradually budding" to "slight."}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:21.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore! What are you, a rabid dog?! {rinTLC: he doesn't technically say "dog", but i think it sounds better in english.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:24.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since it's like this, who cares about the first?! Who cares about a kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll rub your chest until you don't care about that anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.63,0:05:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a high school boy who was going to forcibly sexually harass an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:47.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,just this once, I don't want to believe that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:54.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should be the one apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:02.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Hachikuji, you sure know how to put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.57,0:06:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It happens a lot in school. You put up a good fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to always fight like that with my sister. {rinTLC: rephrase?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose this sort of fight is over if one side apologizes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.92,0:06:19.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Ararararagi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time there are two extra "ra"s.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:26.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that was on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I st-stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:33.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone misspeaks at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you saying that you haven't stuttered once since you were born?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not exactly, but at least I don't stutter when saying someone else's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:46.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, please say "nanamumi nanamome namamamamo" three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} didn't even say it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Namamome is so obscene!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.16,0:06:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said it, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:55.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Namamamamo is obscene, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is that obscene? I don't really get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:03.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, won't saying it intentionally be more difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Namamamamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.01,0:07:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Namamamamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:11.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then may I know what happened, Araragi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:18.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just thought of how I should apologize to my sister, and I got a bit depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having to apologize...\NDon't tell me you touched her breasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would touch their own sister's breasts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I left the house today, I sort of had a quarrel with my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:32.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to fight constantly with my mother and father, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not physically, though.\NOnly verbally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As an only daughter, it's not really my place to say this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They looked like a happy couple on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:48.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen them get along...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were constantly fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You love your mother, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:00.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, I love my father as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:13.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though my father and mother fought constantly and eventually split up, I still love them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why, because of that, I'm feeling uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My father seems to hate my mother a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because of that, he doesn't let me see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:31.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder, if this continues, will I forget my mother someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:35.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can never see her again, will I stop loving her someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so uneasy... {rinTLC: in a "worried", "anxious" sense}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:43.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I smell another woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:49.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This scent of shampoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It belongs to Hanekawa-san, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To a certain extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.83,0:09:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can also think of it as using the shape of the waist to differentiate women.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.54,0:09:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember displaying such special abilities.{?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.46,0:09:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.05,0:09:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't react like it's not ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:15.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have an outstanding pelvic stance. It looks rather suitable for childbirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:19.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I think you'll be able to give birth to a healthy baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that to me recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those were the words of some other pervert out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, Hanekawa-san came, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:32.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she came.\NShe already went home, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She merely passed by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:40.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have heard the details from Oshino-san, right, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, it seems that I have to apologize to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:50.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino-san told me I should.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly need to apologize for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:10:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if there's only one actual truth, you can have two truths from two different perspectives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A method to determine which truth is true doesn't actually exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:11.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no real method of proving your truth in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But believing that you're wrong for that reason is also wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:25.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He talks as if he can see right through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.08,0:10:26.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not you, but rather Oshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:35.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you said doesn't seem to have any connection with the current situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.14,0:10:43.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way to get released from the snail, the lost cow, is apparently rather simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.98,0:10:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get lost because you follow the snail, so if you go away from it, you won't be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:52.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get lost because you follow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the case of the snail, it seems that the human that becomes its target is led astray. {rinTLC: <&Kaf|ZzZ> or, rather - "invites strangeness" <&Kaf|ZzZ> good chance he's saying that if you're the target of a lost snail <&Kaf|ZzZ> you're apt to exhibit strange behavior <&Kaf|ZzZ> ie. <&Kaf|ZzZ> Koyomi fighting little lolis that aren't there [13:09] <&Kaf|ZzZ> so "led in the direction of the strangeness - ie. snail/abnormality}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:02.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why you only need to get away from the snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, not me, right? Hachikuji does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:11.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it's like that, don't you find it weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't follow the snail on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way she'd want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I need to apologize to you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.39,0:11:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, even so, I hope you'll let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any bad intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, it wasn't on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought for certain that I had made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:38.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:40.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:45.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For over two years, I have not been normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If something happened, I would think that it was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.21,0:11:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:54.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji-chan, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.84,0:11:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You felt bad on Mother's Day, fought with your sister, didn't want to go back home...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.31,0:12:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:20.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was just about 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.45,0:12:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At a certain place, a husband and wife walked toward the end of marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.70,0:12:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was decided that their only daughter would go with the father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what one's memories are, they get worn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what one's memories are, they deteriorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:39.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the flow of time, the only daughter was shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:43.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She no longer remembered her mother's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if she looked at her mother's photos,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:50.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she couldn't tell if that was really her own mother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:56.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why the only daughter decided to go see her mother on the Mother's Day of that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:13:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she did not reach her mother's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:05.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:07.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really, why was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:15.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The traffic light was clearly green.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:19.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That only daughter is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From then on, were you always lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A person who cannot reach her destination will hinder another person's way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:32.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Going around in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Basically, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But are you sure you can't see Hachikuji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:44.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I can't even hear her voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:46.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you were acting so naturally...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.03,0:13:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't see that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only thing I see is a person talking to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The last thing I saw was Araragi-kun going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:14:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I totally didn't understand what you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:05.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's like that, you only need to tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.26,0:14:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,811)}Like I said, there's no way I could just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.22,0:14:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for me to just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If such a thing happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the thing that you could see, I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I would normally think that it's me that has a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:21.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara doesn't want to feel that something is wrong with her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:29.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want to feel that she became abnormal once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She doesn't want me to feel that way either...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:34.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why she pretended to be able to see Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:37.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.88,0:14:43.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The one who ran into the snail... was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, Oshino-san said that the criteria for meeting the lost cow is the desire not to return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But everyone thinks that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.73,0:14:59.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every family has their problems, no matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:03.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:06.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friction and strain in her family...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:12.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But because of that, Araragi-kun, dealing with the lost cow is very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.24,0:15:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I said from the start that as long as you stop following it and distance yourself, it'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all you need to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.46,0:15:24.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"It's a strange thing that isn't very evil or strong."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"It isn't really a dangerous threat in the first place." That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:31.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What I mean is how to get this girl-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:42.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How to get Hachikuji to her mother's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This child does not exist there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She does not exist there, nor does she exist anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.99,0:15:58.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji. The child called Hachikuji Mayoi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:02.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:06.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why this child is not being possessed by something, but is that something itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.47,0:16:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Araragi-san, it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:18.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-san, everything is exactly as Senjougahara-san said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:19.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:20.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.27,0:16:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:26.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may not have heard it, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This girl said some really outrageous things to me and Hanekawa from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.87,0:16:35.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you understand, Senjougahara?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.75,0:16:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because she doesn't want anyone to follow her, that's why she says such things to everyone she meets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you understand that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.34,0:16:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I totally don't understand, but even so, when I was missing and when I was all alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:17:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the feeling of having the need to say such things...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,haven't we experienced the same thing, just in a different way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:11.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though you can't see her, hear her voice, or even smell her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:13.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so... That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my duty to bring her safely to her mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew you would say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.46,0:17:29.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I finally understand you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you found out about my problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you took the initiative to speak to me on that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you perhaps offer help solely because it was me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:52.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was purely...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.74,0:17:59.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,because you'll save anyone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Save them... it's nothing that amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But two years after encountering that strange thing, even though many people realized my problem... {rinTLC: fix "strange thing" please :)}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the only person like you was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.85,0:18:19.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure. I'm just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.15,0:18:29.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the last message Oshino-san left, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Just this once, I'll teach you a trick that can be of use."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:36.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go? Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To Tsunade-san's house, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:45.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:18:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The lost cow, as an anomaly, is a ghost-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.90,0:19:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Due to this, it can't store new\Ninformation-oriented memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Information-oriented memories are, basically, knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:19.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's understandable for a person like me who has no geographic knowledge at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:28.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for Senjougahara, who can't even see the snail, to be lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, something you don't know will still be unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.38,0:19:33.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Even if you know, you will be unable to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For instance, take the district map.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you only choose the newly-built routes, the lost cow will be unable to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:49.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After an hour going somewhere that shouldn't even take ten minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.61,0:19:53.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we finally reached the destination.\NBut...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, are you sure this is the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:07.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it... {rinTLC: literally, "Something like this actually exists?" in a disbelieving manner.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:59.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've done well, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.26,0:21:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were perhaps a tiny bit cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:04.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This time it's all thanks to you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:09.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, that's not what I mean, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.77,0:21:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have not given me an answer yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.07,0:21:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:21.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I think you might have misunderstood something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, didn't you mention something about repaying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was only an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I merely wanted you to confess on your own. {rinTLC: in the sense of "confess your love" / "ask me out"}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:38.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really feel that I owe you something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because you love to help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.43,0:21:47.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But even if the person that was being helped was not me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:52.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if, from the side, I watched you help Hanekawa-san or the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.85,0:21:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would still have developed special feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, though I seem to have said this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you insist, I find talking to you to be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:09.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we haven't really talked that much, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.21,0:22:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I hope to speak more with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.50,0:22:20.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do I put it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:22.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because I've taken a liking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:26.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I want to try hard, or something like that anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.22,0:22:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.31,0:22:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, well how about you think of it like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.06,0:22:34.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, a psychotic virgin,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,starved for love and likely to fall for anyone who would be a little nice to her, has set her eyes on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are really unlucky.\NBlame it on your habitual actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.62,0:22:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are to say something stupid like, "Give me a bit of time to consider,"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will despise you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.21,0:22:59.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let a girl feel shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:00.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.13,0:23:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At this point in time, I feel that I'm really horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But is it all right if I offer one condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really a condition... It's more like a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A promise? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:21.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara, pretending to see things that you actually can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.78,0:23:24.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or pretending not to be able to see something you really can...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No more of that, from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.49,0:23:31.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If our views clash, then let us properly talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:32.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A simple request.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.21,0:23:40.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's already getting dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:47.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, could you clearly say it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:48.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.80,0:23:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I hate unclear relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.30,0:23:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.19,0:23:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope this will be popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:23:59.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.86,0:24:01.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Senjougahara fascination."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.49,0:24:09.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi, it's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.37,0:24:13.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.95,0:24:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I promised that on Mother's Day next year, I will definitely not take a single step from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:20.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It may be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.46,0:24:22.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom said we'll be washing the bedsheets today!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:26.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said that she can only start washing when you wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.22,0:24:30.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When morning came, my sisters seemed to have calmed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.41,0:24:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:53.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.37,0:24:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You left out a "ra" this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.41,0:25:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.71,0:25:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, how do I put it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.79,0:25:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.50,0:25:10.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have been promoted from an earthbound spirit into a wandering spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:12.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means I was promoted two ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.01,0:25:15.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Umm, Araragi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.60,0:25:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will probably be around here for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you see me, please talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.98,0:25:27.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.\NI'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.57,0:25:29.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An octopus spits ink.\NSpits, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's also a fish that spits ink.\NSpit-Spit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.78,0:25:31.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might think that's all.\NEh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.95,0:25:33.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they inhale ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.16,0:25:34.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ehh.. it's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:35.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, which is it?\NYou know...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there is a fish which spits ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.29,0:25:38.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Akanagana, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.41,0:25:39.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{WHAT YOU SAY?!} How do you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:40.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know of most black things!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.04,0:25:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Time for today's baseball quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.96,0:25:42.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.87,0:25:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are a baseball pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.13,0:25:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The pitcher raises his hands above his head and pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.67,0:25:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the first, second, and even the third and fourth pitch are all fouled off straight pitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.22,0:25:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No control!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.13,0:25:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now for the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.26,0:25:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your fourth pitch was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.72,0:25:55.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.14,0:25:57.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be a straight...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.85,0:25:59.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, Suruga Monkey Part 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.93,0:26:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a question of straight pitch victory or defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.31,0:26:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't clever.
